<title>FINLAND: TAMPELLA SWINGS TO FIM 141 MLN 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>TAMPELLA SWINGS TO FIM 141 MLN 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     141 vs 188 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.41 vs 2.46 loss</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		     nil vs nil</p>
<p> Net sales					  4,520 vs 4,460</p>
<p> Operating profit				   199 vs 115 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish engineering</p>
<p>group Tampella Oy had been for a 154 million markka profit (mean</p>
<p>150 million) in a 121-175 million markka range.</p>
<p> Depreciation					 168 vs 203</p>
<p> Net interest				 charge 52 vs 53 charge</p>
<p> Other net financial items		 charge 6 vs 20 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			  gain 14 vs 195 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  155 vs 383 loss</p>
<p> Taxes						   72 vs 24</p>
<p> Profit before minorities			  82 vs 405 loss</p>
<p> Minorities				   charge 17 vs 29 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					    65 vs 434 loss</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    19.2 vs 16.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Oy Tampella</p>
<p>Ab.</p>
